  "responsibility": "Reads a coherent aggregate from disk, by its name or a name it used to have",
  "description": "readSemanticBoard asks Former names which board a name answers to; readSemanticBoardAt synchronously reads fresh bytes, asks Decode board bytes to parse and migrate the shared semantic schema, distinguishes missing from unreadable files, and rejects a document whose internal name disagrees with its address. A document of an older contract is migrated, and persisted when its lease is free, before it is answered. readSemanticBoardAtAsLeased, for a question asked before a write, answers a board that awaits its migration as the migration would leave it, at the version the migration commits, and persists nothing. An explicit migrate:false read normalizes older schemas in memory and preserves exact source bytes. Browser snapshots and listings use this form. Ordinary CLI reads retain automatic schema migration.",
